","patch":"Index: /workspace/README.md\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/README.md\n+++ /workspace/README.md\n@@ -11,5 +11,5 @@\n \n - `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n - `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n \n-Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n+Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions with hashes and is installed directly as a pip requirements file (falling back to `backend/requirements.txt`). The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n","additions":1,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"README.md","time":{"start":1794380499294,"end":1794380499321}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c9698958001tyQAvGh3rff0nO","sessionID":"ses_e36ac0041ffeAjsRq7kwpL3mQR","messageID":"msg_1c969095c001x9v3XagvEpyz4B"}}
